{"availability":"available","full":"miuele/gh-memo","name":"gh-memo","description":"A local-first note-taking app and a remote repository viewer","category":"Productivity","language":"JavaScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-04-07T09:11:48Z","updated":"2026-09-02T11:42:32Z","branch":"master","homepage":"https://miuele.github.io/gh-memo-app","topics":[],"demo":"https://miuele.github.io/gh-memo-app","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T20:08:48.042Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T20:08:48.042Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T20:08:48.042Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-04T08:18:07.563Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-06T16:30:58.802Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-08T20:08:48.042Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["This is a single-page, zero-backend web application for note-taking and file editing. It is designed around a local-first architecture: all files are cached and edited directly within the browser using IndexedDB. The application syncs directly to remote cloud providers (GitHub and Dropbox) via their REST APIs entirely from the client side. There is no intermediate backend or database server.","Because it operates natively in the browser, the application works offline and can be installed as a Progressive Web App (PWA)."],"features":["Offline-First: All file creation, deletion, and editing operations happen instantly against the local IndexedDB cache.","Direct API Sync: Users can selectively push or pull files directly to a configured GitHub repository (via the Contents API) or a Dropbox folder.","Conflict Resolution: If a file is modified locally and remotely, the application intercepts the pull request and provides a basic text diff merge to prevent data loss.","Cross-Tab Locking: Utilizes the browser's BroadcastChannel API to detect if a file is being edited in another tab, freezing the UI to prevent local overwrite conflicts.","Decoupled Credentials: Authentication tokens (Keychains) are managed separately from repository configurations (Workspaces). A single GitHub token can be mapped to multiple workspace mount points."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/miuele/gh-memo/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"af6eabd68d22100284fcbe7d0be86b11a21f6a96bac756ef956a1518c1696d82","extractedAt":"2026-10-04T08:18:07.751Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-04T08:18:07.751Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"This is a single-page, zero-backend web application for note-taking and file editing. It is designed around a local-first architecture: all files are cached and edited directly within the browser using IndexedDB. The application syncs directly to remote cloud providers (GitHub and Dropbox) via their REST APIs entirely from the client side. There is no intermediate backend or database server.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/miuele/gh-memo/blob/master/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"api_key","status":"optional","text":"Optionally, get your GitHub Personal Access Token (PAT), paste it in the settings and fill in the repository name.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/miuele/gh-memo/blob/master/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"af6eabd68d22100284fcbe7d0be86b11a21f6a96bac756ef956a1518c1696d82","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/miuele/gh-memo/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-04T08:18:07.751Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-09-02T11:42:32Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/miuele/gh-memo/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-04T08:18:07.751Z","hash":"af6eabd68d22100284fcbe7d0be86b11a21f6a96bac756ef956a1518c1696d82","originalBytes":4994,"storedBytes":4994,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["file","application","files","repository","github","api","browser","dropbox","local","button","contents","mount","token","access","app","configured","content","data","directly","editing","locally","make","markdown","notes","pull","remote","rendering","text","via","work